  DisplayName: Mirage Archer
  Description: Creates an autonomous copy that continues attacking. The copy deals reduced damage and has limited duration. Maximum 1 Summoned Mirage Archer When you Hit an Enemy with an Arrow from a Supported Skill, Summon a Mirage Archer which uses that SkillMirage Archer can use Triggered Attacks as though they were not Triggered Mirage Archer uses Supported Skill with #% less Attack Speed Mirage Archer lasts # seconds
